{
  "info": {
    "name": "Go-FoodStore",
    "description": "REST API pemesanan makanan (Go + gorm + gorilla/mux + MySQL).\n\nJalankan `docker compose up --build` lalu pakai collection ini apa adanya.\n\nCatatan: route koleksi memakai trailing slash (`/food/`, bukan `/food`).\n\nUrutan yang disarankan untuk alur penuh:\n1. Food > Create food\n2. Customer > Create customer\n3. Transaction > Create transaction\n4. Transaction > Get unpaid transactions\n5. Transaction > Accept payment\n6. Transaction > Get paid transactions\n\nPENTING: status code HTTP selalu 200. Tidak ada w.WriteHeader di repo, jadi kode 400/404/405/304 hanya muncul di field `Code` dalam body, bukan di status HTTP. Kalau menulis test di Postman, periksa `pm.response.json().Code`, bukan `pm.response.code`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (selalu peran customer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"Username\": \"budi\",\n  \"Password\": \"kata-sandi-panjang\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"Username\": \"admin\",\n  \"Password\": \"admin12345\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Menyimpan token ke variabel koleksi supaya request lain tinggal",
                  "// memakai {{token}} tanpa menyalin-tempel manual.",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().Data;",
                  "if (data && data.Token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.Token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get all customers",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cust/",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cust",
                ""
              ]
            }
          }
        },
